{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;That game is called Retro Endurance 8bit. It's on Steam... I think you should give it a look. I think it's really neat. It's really neat.&quot;</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Jeff Gerstmann (former editorial director of Gamespot, co-founder of Giant Bomb)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About Retro Endurance 8-bit:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro Endurance delivers inventive reimagining of NES classics with a fun rapid-fire shuffler style gameplay and some modern twists, helping you to relive your nostalgic memories. All 30 games in this collection are built to be unique with no two games playing alike and each are designed to be fun in its own unique way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rapid-Fire Mini-Games:\u00a0\u00a0</strong>Unleash a whirlwind of lightning-fast mini-games, with a unique and fun shuffler style gameplay, keeping players on their toes and their reflexes razor-sharp.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Game Genres:\u00a0 </strong>Features a variety of game genres,  ensuring there\u2019s something for everyone.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade Mode:\u00a0</strong>Unlock and play some of your favorite games individually.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Fun:\u00a0</strong>Compete in split-screen local competitive multiplayer mode</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Daily Challenges:</strong>\u00a0Perform and climb the high-score leaderboard with a new challenge each day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique boss battles</strong>: Battle the boss while switching between different game genres until you deplete its hit points.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tested for Steam Deck Compatibility</strong>:\u00a0 Fully compatible with the Steam Deck, take the pulse-pounding action anywhere you go.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>The Shuffler Mode:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Shuffler Mode is what makes this game very fun and unique. It plays with a board game style progression, always starting and ending with a randomly picked racing game. In between, it picks a few randomly chosen games. Each game plays for 3 rounds with the 3rd round playing at twice the speed. The main goal of Shuffler Mode is to get as high of a cumulative score as possible between all the games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412560/extras/Store-Gameplay.png?t=1743442984\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Games:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro Endurance 8bit features many games based on favorite classic 8bit games. Games based on popular genres such as platformers, puzzles, brawler, racing, RPG, and much much more! No two games play alike and they are all designed to be fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412560/extras/GameCollage.png?t=1743442984\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo developed game. Designed, coded, drawn, and composed by zsKnight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random generation algorithms in all games so they will feel different each time you play them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More games will be added  and included free in future updates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many secrets and easter eggs to be discovered!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 5","path":"https://c