nlock and play some of your favorite games individually.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Fun:\u00a0</strong>Compete in split-screen local competitive multiplayer mode</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Daily Challenges:</strong>\u00a0Perform and climb the high-score leaderboard with a new challenge each day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique boss battles</strong>: Battle the boss while switching between different game genres until you deplete its hit points.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tested for Steam Deck Compatibility</strong>:\u00a0 Fully compatible with the Steam Deck, take the pulse-pounding action anywhere you go.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>The Shuffler Mode:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Shuffler Mode is what makes this game very fun and unique. It plays with a board game style progression, always starting and ending with a randomly picked racing game. In between, it picks a few randomly chosen games. Each game plays for 3 rounds with the 3rd round playing at twice the speed. The main goal of Shuffler Mode is to get as high of a cumulative score as possible between all the games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412560/extras/Store-Gameplay.png?t=1743442984\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Games:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro Endurance 8bit features many games based on favorite classic 8bit games. Games based on popular genres such as platformers, puzzles, brawler, racing, RPG, and much much more! No two games play alike and they are all designed to be fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412560/extras/GameCollage.png?t=1743442984\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo developed game. Designed, coded, drawn, and composed by zsKnight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random generation algorithms in all games so they will feel different each time you play them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More games will be added  and included free in future updates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many secrets and easter eggs to be discovered!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["zsKnight"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412560/header.jpg?t=1743442984","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257085426,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085426/movie480.mp4?t=1738373340","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085426/movie_max.mp4?t=1738373340"},"name":"Retro Endurance 8bit Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257085426/153f5d236c5a22bbe65400ae221ab163a44e4731/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738373340","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085426/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1738373340","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085426/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1738373340"}}],"name":"Retro Endurance 8bit","package_groups":[{"description"